# Run Away Together: "two target creatures" is exactly two (CR 115.1), though with three players three creatures can each have a different controller.
# On Bot1's turn 4 Bot1's Ornithopter, Bot2's Elvish Mystic and Bot3's Llanowar Elves are refused as three targets; two of them (Ornithopter and Elves, Bot1 and Bot3)
# are taken, and Bot2's Mystic stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Run Away Together
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest x18

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

